<title>BELGIUM: Belgian BMT 1996 net profit jumps 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgian BMT 1996 net profit jumps 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(millions of francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit				   254.7    v   202.7</p>
<p>    Current net profit				300.9    v   248.9</p>
<p>    Cons turnover					5,450   v  5,264</p>
<p>    Depreciation					  304.0  v   314.2</p>
<p>    Current net cash flow			     613    v   569.2</p>
<p>    Current net profit per share (francs)	 396    v   328</p>
<p>    Current pre-tax profit			   533.3   v   445.0</p>
<p>    Writedown of consolidation goodwill	   46.2   v    46.2</p>
<p>    Net dividend per share (francs)		 59     v     n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - BMT NV is a Belgian metals group.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
